---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Work" description="Jeff Thilmany’s professional focus: business solutions, Power Platform, .NET development, business process automation, and AI-assisted software engineering.">
  <section class="container section work-hero">
    <div class="work-intro">
      <p class="eyebrow">Work / Business solutions</p>
      <h1>Less friction.<br />More <span>possibility.</span></h1>
      <p class="lead">Build useful software. Solve the right problem. My professional focus sits where business processes meet software: Power Platform, .NET development, automation, and AI-assisted engineering.</p>
      <div class="actions"><a class="button" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jeffreythilmany" rel="me">Professional profile ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="/projects">Explore my personal code ↗</a></div>
    </div>
    <figure class="work-blueprint" aria-labelledby="blueprint-caption">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 440 380" width="440" height="380" role="img" aria-labelledby="work-blueprint-title">
        <title id="work-blueprint-title">Illustration of a problem becoming a process and a software build</title>
        <defs><pattern id="work-grid" width="22" height="22" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><path d="M22 0H0V22" fill="none" stroke="var(--line)" stroke-width=".6" /></pattern></defs>
        <rect x="1" y="1" width="438" height="378" rx="22" fill="url(#work-grid)" />
        <g fill="none" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.5"><path class="blueprint-route" d="M105 102H305Q327 102 327 124V188Q327 210 305 210H135Q113 210 113 232V280H282" /><circle cx="105" cy="102" r="7" fill="var(--bg)" /><circle cx="282" cy="280" r="7" fill="var(--bg)" /></g>
        <g fill="var(--panel)" stroke="var(--line)"><rect x="51" y="50" width="156" height="72" rx="12" /><rect x="227" y="159" width="157" height="72" rx="12" /><rect x="55" y="263" width="156" height="72" rx="12" /></g>
        <g fill="none" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="78" cy="85" r="10" /><path d="M75 82a3 3 0 0 1 6 0c0 3-3 2-3 5m0 4h.01" /><path d="M246 184h18v22h-18zm4 7h10m-10 6h6" /><path d="m82 286-8 10 8 10m12-20 8 10-8 10" /></g>
        <g fill="var(--text)" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="13"><text x="101" y="90">PROBLEM</text><text x="278" y="201">PROCESS</text><text x="112" y="301">BUILD</text></g>
        <g fill="var(--muted)" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="10"><text x="53" y="35">THE SHAPE OF USEFUL SOFTWARE</text><text x="247" y="329">UNDERSTAND → CONNECT → CREATE</text></g>
      </svg>
      <figcaption id="blueprint-caption"><span class="blueprint-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> A thinking map, not a one-size-fits-all recipe.</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </section>

  <section class="headline-band reveal" aria-labelledby="headline-label">
    <div class="container headline-inner">
      <p id="headline-label" class="eyebrow">From my public LinkedIn headline</p>
      <blockquote>
        <p>Business Solutions Analyst <span>@ AbbVie</span></p>
        <footer>Power Platform & .NET Developer <span aria-hidden="true">/</span> Business Process Automation <span aria-hidden="true">/</span> AI-Assisted Software Engineering</footer>
      </blockquote>
      <p class="headline-context">These are my public areas of focus. LinkedIn is the place for my full professional background and current details.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container section work-flow reveal" aria-labelledby="focus-heading">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">01 / Three connected areas</p><h2 id="focus-heading">Think it through.<br />Then connect the dots.</h2></div><p class="flow-note">Problem → Process → Build<br /><span>Useful beats complicated.</span></p></div>
    <ol class="focus-flow">
      <li>
        <div class="flow-node"><svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" width="40" height="40" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="7" y="7" width="26" height="26" rx="7" /><path d="M13 15h14m-14 6h9m-9 6h5" /><circle cx="29" cy="28" r="6" fill="var(--panel)" /><path d="m33 33 4 4" /></svg><span>01 / Problem</span></div>
        <h3>Power Platform<br />& .NET</h3>
        <p>Business-facing tools and software development are two sides of the same question: what does someone need to accomplish, and what is the right way to support it?</p>
        <p class="muted">My focus combines Power Platform and .NET rather than treating every problem as a reason to choose the same tool.</p>
        <p class="flow-question">What needs to change?</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <div class="flow-node"><svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" width="40" height="40" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="15" width="10" height="10" rx="2" /><rect x="27" y="3" width="10" height="10" rx="2" /><rect x="27" y="27" width="10" height="10" rx="2" /><path d="M13 20h7V8h7M20 20v12h7" /><circle cx="20" cy="20" r="2" fill="var(--accent)" /></svg><span>02 / Process</span></div>
        <h3>Business process<br />automation</h3>
        <p>Automation starts with the process itself: the inputs, decisions, handoffs, and exceptions. Understanding those pieces matters before deciding what should run automatically.</p>
        <p class="muted">The goal is useful, understandable software—not complexity for its own sake.</p>
        <p class="flow-question">What should we build?</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <div class="flow-node"><svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" width="40" height="40" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m12 12-8 8 8 8m16-16 8 8-8 8M23 8l-6 24m16-29 1.5 4.5L39 9l-4.5 1.5L33 15l-1.5-4.5L27 9l4.5-1.5Z" /></svg><span>03 / Build</span></div>
        <h3>AI-assisted<br />engineering</h3>
        <p>AI-assisted software engineering is part of my professional focus. I’m interested in using these tools to explore ideas and support development while keeping human judgment central.</p>
        <p class="muted">Generated code is still code: its behavior, clarity, and fit for the problem matter.</p>
        <p class="flow-question">Can someone understand it?</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="toolbelt-band reveal" aria-labelledby="toolbelt-heading">
    <div class="container toolbelt-inner">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">02 / Toolbelt</p><h2 id="toolbelt-heading">Different tools.<br />Shared purpose.</h2></div>
      <ul class="toolbelt" aria-label="Professional focus areas">
        <li class="power-badge"><span aria-hidden="true">P<span class="badge-offset">P</span></span><strong>Power<br />Platform</strong></li>
        <li class="dotnet-badge"><span aria-hidden="true">.NET</span><strong>Software<br />development</strong></li>
        <li class="automation-badge"><svg width="38" height="38" viewBox="0 0 38 38" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 10h21l-5-5m5 5-5 5M30 28H9l5 5m-5-5 5-5" /><path d="M6 14v10m26-10v10" /></svg><strong>Process<br />automation</strong></li>
        <li class="ai-badge"><span aria-hidden="true">{'{✦}'}</span><strong>AI-assisted<br />engineering</strong></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container section work-outro reveal" aria-labelledby="profile-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">Professional context / Personal curiosity</p>
    <h2 id="profile-heading">The profile. And the playground.</h2>
    <p class="lead">For my full professional profile, head to LinkedIn. For public code you can inspect, explore my personal repositories here—separate from workplace work.</p>
    <div class="actions"><a class="button" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jeffreythilmany" rel="me">Continue on LinkedIn ↗</a><a class="button secondary" href="/projects">Personal projects ↗</a></div>
  </section>
</Base>
<style>
  .work-hero { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr; align-items: center; gap: 42px; padding-block: 88px; }
  .work-intro h1 { font-size: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5.4rem); }
  .work-intro h1 span { color: var(--accent); }
  .work-blueprint { min-width: 0; margin: 0; }
  .work-blueprint svg { width: 100%; height: auto; }
  .work-blueprint figcaption { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; padding-top: 12px; color: var(--muted); font: 11px var(--font-mono); }
  .blueprint-dot { width: 6px; height: 6px; flex-shrink: 0; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent); }
  .blueprint-route { stroke-dasharray: 5 7; animation: blueprint-flow 14s linear infinite; }
  .headline-band { padding-block: 60px; background: var(--soft); border-block: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .headline-inner { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .headline-band blockquote { margin: 8px 0 24px; }
  .headline-band blockquote p { max-width: 1040px; margin: 0 0 24px; font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5.5vw, 4.6rem); line-height: 1.12; letter-spacing: -.045em; font-weight: 600; }
  .headline-band blockquote p span { color: var(--accent); white-space: nowrap; }
  .headline-band blockquote footer { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; color: var(--text); font: 12px/1.8 var(--font-mono); }
  .headline-band blockquote footer span { color: var(--accent); }
  .headline-context { max-width: 640px; margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; }
  .flow-note { margin: 0; color: var(--accent); font: 12px/1.8 var(--font-mono); }
  .flow-note span { color: var(--muted); }
  .focus-flow { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); list-style: none; margin: 48px 0 0; padding: 0; }
  .focus-flow li { min-width: 0; position: relative; padding-right: 36px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .focus-flow li:last-child { padding-right: 0; }
  .flow-node { position: relative; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; padding-block: 0 34px; color: var(--accent); }
  .flow-node::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: 20px; left: 52px; right: 0; height: 1px; background: var(--line); }
  .focus-flow li:not(:last-child) .flow-node::after { content: '→'; position: absolute; right: -20px; top: 7px; color: var(--accent); }
  .flow-node svg { position: relative; background: var(--bg); flex: 0 0 40px; }
  .flow-node span { position: relative; padding-right: 12px; background: var(--bg); font: 11px var(--font-mono); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .08em; }
  .focus-flow h3 { font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.4vw, 2rem); min-height: 2.3em; }
  .focus-flow p { font-size: 14px; }
  .focus-flow .flow-question { margin: auto 0 0; padding-top: 24px; color: var(--accent); font: 12px var(--font-mono); }
  .toolbelt-band { background: var(--panel); border-block: 1px solid var(--line); padding-block: 48px; }
  .toolbelt-inner { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr; gap: 36px; align-items: center; }
  .toolbelt-inner h2 { margin: 0; }
  .toolbelt { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; gap: 12px; }
  .toolbelt li { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 18px; padding: 22px; background: var(--bg); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px; }
  .toolbelt li > span, .toolbelt svg { min-width: 54px; color: var(--accent); }
  .toolbelt strong { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; font-weight: 550; }
  .power-badge > span { position: relative; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 800; font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -6px; }
  .badge-offset { color: var(--muted); font-size: 24px; }
  .dotnet-badge > span { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -.08em; }
  .ai-badge > span { font: 24px var(--font-mono); }
  .work-outro { max-width: 1200px; }
  @keyframes blueprint-flow { to { stroke-dashoffset: -120; } }
  @media (max-width: 960px) { .work-hero { grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr; gap: 24px; } .focus-flow li { padding-right: 24px; } .toolbelt-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .work-hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding-block: 56px; gap: 34px; }
    .work-blueprint { width: min(440px, 100%); margin-inline: auto; }
    .headline-band { padding-block: 42px; }
    .headline-band blockquote footer { display: block; }
    .headline-band blockquote footer span { padding-inline: 6px; }
    .focus-flow { grid-template-columns: 1fr; margin-top: 32px; gap: 34px; }
    .focus-flow li, .focus-flow li:last-child { padding: 0 0 0 26px; border-left: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .flow-node { padding-bottom: 20px; }
    .flow-node::before { display: none; }
    .focus-flow li:not(:last-child) .flow-node::after { content: '↓'; left: -33px; right: auto; top: 2px; background: var(--bg); padding-block: 8px; }
    .focus-flow h3 { min-height: 0; }
    .focus-flow .flow-question { padding-top: 4px; }
    .toolbelt { gap: 10px; }
    .toolbelt li { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; padding: 20px 16px; gap: 12px; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .blueprint-route { animation: none; } }
</style>
